<title>UK: John Lewis UK dept store sales up 4.6% in last wk.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK dept store sales up 4.6% in last wk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales rose 4.6 percent in the week to March 15 over the same week a year ago.</p>
<p>In the seven weeks to March 15, sales were up 8.4 percent versus the same period last year.</p>
<p>Total sales, including those from the Waitrose supermarket chain, rose 3.4 percent in the week to March 15 and up 6.4 percent in seven weeks to March 15.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
